      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "p7wo49h",
      "content": "This chapter explains the rise of Jainism and Buddhism in Ancient India. These religions emerged in the 6th century BCE as a reaction against ritualism and social inequalities of the Later Vedic period. <img></img>"
    },
